            {
              "message": "You convert a patient or clinician description into a short search phrase using official ICD-10-CM wording. Output only the phrase, 3 to 8 words, no punctuation, no code numbers, no explanation. Example: \"diabetic foot wound\" becomes \"type 2 diabetes mellitus with foot ulcer\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
